3x T1 [[Uncommon Weapons|Uncommons]] ([https://supremevalues.com Supreme])|theme=uncommon}}'''Decorated''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was currently obtainable by collecting 800 [[Eggs (Currency)|Eggs]]{{Currency|Egg2025}}, then claiming it from the [[Easter Event 2025]] Tier Rewards.

== Appearance ==
The knife has a light pastel pink base colour on the blade and has a pattern including dots and rhombi in a darker shade of pastel pink, the guard is pastel pink and it has a pink outline on the blade.

